Employer in discharge of this onerous responsibility is required to inter alia consider following factors:-
(i) The nature of allegations;
(ii) Overt act alleged against candidate;
(iii) Whether the allegations are solely against individual candidate or have been alleged with the aid of section 34/149 of IPC (iv) The criminal antecedents of the candidate ;
(v) Overall reputation of the candidate in his locality/society etc. "
